  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bfcb709b487afd749b8fbd2c4c50e261, type: 3}
  m_Name: Mage
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: CardDungeon::Assets.Scripts.Heroes.HeroSO
  Key: Mage
  Vision:
    Fantasy: An elemental mage, found walled up in the Sealed Archive. Commands storm,
      frost and fire, and is rarely careful about which. DRAFT by Claude 2026-10-07
      - the owner's to rewrite.
    Role: 'Intelligence caster: elemental damage, area hits and the tag combos (Freeze
      in his own frost branch, Ignite with the Tinkerer''s oil), plus the self-cast
      cloaks that answer an elemental floor.'
    SignatureMechanic: 'Focus and MultiCast: he builds Focus during combat (how exactly
      is not decided yet) and spends it to double-cast, triple-cast or even quadruple-cast.
      MultiCast is both his signature and his Ultra.'
    UltraStyle: MultiCast
    Ultras:
    - Name: MultiCast
      Effect: Spend Focus to cast the next ability 2, 3 or 4 times (double-, triple-,
        quadruple-cast). A rough idea; the details are not decided.
      Unlock: Signature (trunk)
    Branches:
    - GridBranch: a
      Becomes: 'Storm: speed and reach.'
      IntendedKit: Storm Cloak -> Chain Lightning
      Summon: 'Qyraxis (lightning bird) - special attack: Lightning on every enemy
        twice, then Agility down for 2 turns.'
    - GridBranch: b
      Becomes: 'Frost and water: Freeze on his own, and the sturdier body.'
      IntendedKit: Ice Shard -> Water Splash -> Frost Cloak
      Summon: "Glacius, a frost bear - special attack: It causes a single target
        melee ice claw attack. its Attack lays Ice, so Water from the party sets
        off Freeze. \nSecondarily he grants a temporary health bonus to allies (starts
        of low, 5% or something. Can be upgraded)"
    - GridBranch: c
      Becomes: 'Fire: the Ashen Deep''s answer first (Fire Cloak at the third node),
        then the blast.'
      IntendedKit: Fireball -> fire cloak? -> emberstorm? (Was on warlock before?)
      Summon: 'Ifrit - party replacement: Standard replacement, has a normal attacks
        and a ranged single target fire attack that burns. When he dies or is dismissdd,
        he casts hell fire. Heavy aoe damage to all enemies'
    Overlaps: Warlock and Cultist are Intelligence casters too, but shadow and blood;
      the Mage owns the elements.
    OpenQuestions: How Focus is built (per cast? per turn? per element switch?) and
      how much each tier costs. Is MultiCast spent through the shared Ultra gauge,
      or does Focus replace the gauge for him? Is Chain Lightning (all enemies, power
      3) the right storm capstone? Working name 'Mage'.
